{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳2段車 Cam 影片，直擊屯門公路發生一宗驚險意外。昨日（22日）下午2時54分，一輛綠色的士沿屯門公路慢線行駛期間，車內一名男子突然打開車門跌出車外並橫臥路邊，險象環生。幸後方車輛及時煞停，尾隨小巴亦急忙切線閃避，才未有釀成嚴重傷亡事故。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m25s301.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026m7Rl53s9ZW1784788501.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m25s301.png\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m29s332.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026gh5pCmCK5P1784788502.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m29s332.png\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m30s951.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026j5Y5FW2xmw1784788502.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m30s951.png\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m42s994.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026n06jpMZp9e1784788501.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-23-12h55m42s994.png\"/><br/> </div><br/> <div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\"><br/> <span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據車 Cam 片段顯示，事發地點位於屯門公路新墟段往九龍方向。當時一輛綠色的士正沿慢線行駛，詎料車內一名男子突然打開車門，整個人「帶滾」跌出車外，跌落路中心。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">當時緊隨其後的車 Cam 車輛司機反應迅速，及時踩煞車減速，未有撞倒該名男子；而尾隨的一輛白色小巴亦及時切線轉向避開，事件中未見造成傷亡。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片上載後隨即引起廣泛熱議。不少網民好奇該名男子的突發舉動與目的，同時指責其行為極度危險、害人害己，紛紛留言討論：「冇錢界（畀）的士錢！」、「唔想俾錢落車都唔使搵命搏」、「搞咩呀條友，睇得戲多」、「做成龍呀？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T07:39:47.476863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":400,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}